proposal.tailwind:
Record:
- app/browser/recipe.json uses the RecipeRecord shape from tests/setup.ts:1870-1880.
- candidates is the sorted, unique union of every CLASS_NAMES.bootstrap leaf and TAILWIND_CLASSES. TAILWIND_CLASSES is a sorted list disjoint from the registry, for example px-8, rounded-full, shadow-xl, ring-2, ring-sky-500, grid, grid-cols-3, bg-sky-500, tracking-wide, size-12, divide-y, space-y-2, md:flex, and mt-[1rem].
- recipe is compileRecipe(RECIPE_INPUT, candidates); unexcluded is the same compile with the Veneer import removed.
- A temporary instrument in the conformance Node environment writes the record and is then deleted.

Conformance pin, one case modelled on tests/conformance.test.ts:1343-1376 and reading readRecipe('app/browser/recipe.json'):
- identities match the installed package and built sheet, and candidates equal the computed union;
- recipe and unexcluded each equal a live compile;
- collectRecipeClasses(recipe) is disjoint from the registry, while collectRecipeClasses(unexcluded) contains collapse, container, and mt-3;
- a planted-rule record differs (control).

Journey readings, driven through the Stylesheets buttons:
1. Face invariance. Over every element in the Bootstrap groups, read readLonghands (tests/setupStyles.ts:462, which excludes custom properties) for the element and ::before, ::after, ::placeholder, ::marker, and ::file-selector-button, plus a document-relative box (the rect plus scrollX and scrollY, read after scrollTo(0,0)). The reading must be identical across faces in every variant. Control: append record.unexcluded; the reading must then report departures, including the collapse show specimen's visibility.
2. TAILWIND_READINGS:
   - px-8 on btn reads 32px versus 12px;
   - mt-3 reads 16px and gap-4 reads 24px under both faces;
   - collapse show reads display block and visibility visible under both;
   - container reads the same under both;
   - rounded-pill rounded-full reads Bootstrap's radius;
   - grid grid-cols-3 reads grid versus block;
   - md:flex reads flex at 1280 and block at 390;
   - mt-[1rem] reads 16px versus 0px;
   - a bare img and ul read inline and disc under both;
   - <div hidden class="d-flex"> reads none versus flex. This is the guide's named departure (guides/veneer.md:435).
3. Census:
   - Under Bootstrap only, readCensus(root).undeclared equals TAILWIND_CLASSES.
   - Under Bootstrap with Tailwind, it equals exactly md:flex and mt-[1rem]. This is the readCascade regex limit (index.js:2196), reported to @orkestrel/test.
   - Page tokens equal the registry plus TAILWIND_CLASSES in both directions, with buildCensus as the control.

The recipe stays the exact three lines. Tailwind's dark: variant follows prefers-color-scheme, so the page uses no dark: utility (decision D2).

