units.proves:
Each check carries its control:
- every registry leaf has a first-matching owner (a planted unknown leaf is the control);
- every row matches a leaf (a dead prefix is the control);
- composables are owned by Engine states;
- section ids and titles are unique (a planted duplicate Position title is the control);
- TAILWIND_CLASSES is sorted, unique, and disjoint from the registry;
- the union of ENGINE_ROWS class cells equals the registry members that engine.json writes, both ways (an appended name is the control).
